{"type":"message","id":"45b4523e","parentId":"878566e1","timestamp":"2026-04-06T07:00:52.839Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"No .gitmodules. Hmm. The error message \"does not have a commit checked out\" is quite specific. Let me try to reproduce the exact error by trying to add workspace-wxlee.\n\nActually, looking at the error more carefully, this is the error you get when running `git add workspace-wxlee/` and workspace-wxlee is itself a git repository (has .git inside it) but has no commits yet. Git can't stage a nested git repo as a directory.\n\nThe solution is either:\n1. Commit inside workspace-wxlee first\n2. Or add workspace-wxlee to .gitignore in the parent repo\n3. Or remove the .git inside workspace-wxlee if it's not meant to be a separate repo\n\nLet me check if workspace-wxlee is supposed to be a separate working directory for another agent/user (wxlee).","thinkingSignature":"5630f5b7b150005479c518ee56ebbc8ad1585b80f628883e90dedd247d3879cb"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_4d9i7jr1fsts_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace-wxlee && git log --oneline -1 2>&1"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"minimax-m2.5:free","usage":{"input":5834,"output":227,"cacheRead":11827,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17888,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775458847373,"responseId":"06228d1fa268981a7cd14a7be5b68102"}}
