{"type":"message","id":"0aa6bfa9","parentId":"5d12e1a4","timestamp":"2026-04-06T07:01:02.038Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"As I suspected, workspace-wxlee has no commits. This is the issue - the directory is a git repo but has no commits, and when the parent repo tries to stage it, git can't handle it.\n\nThe user needs to either:\n1. Initialize and commit in workspace-wxlee (if it's meant to be a separate repo)\n2. Or remove the .git folder if it's not meant to be a separate repo\n3. Or add it to .gitignore\n\nLet me ask the user what they want to do, but first let me explain the issue clearly.Actually, since this is coming through Feishu and they just sent the error, I should explain the issue and offer solutions.","thinkingSignature":"b0d925de8837e11c5d9fdb34287160fe2c6e58a2f89a684484004c807802d9b6"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n这个错误是因为 `workspace-wxlee/` 本身是一个 Git 仓库，但没有提交过任何 commit。当父仓库尝试暂存这个目录时，Git 无法处理嵌套的空白 Git 仓库。\n\n**问题根源：**\n```\nworkspace-wxlee/ 是一个 Git 仓库，但没有任何 commits\n```\n\n**解决方案（选一个）：**\n\n1. **初始化并提交**（如果这是另一个独立的工作区）：\n   ```bash\n   cd workspace-wxlee\n   git add .\n   git commit -m \"Initial commit\"\n   ```\n\n2. **删除嵌套的 .git**（如果 workspace-wxlee 不需要是独立仓库）：\n   ```bash\n   rm -rf workspace-wxlee/.git\n   ```\n\n3. **添加到 .gitignore**（保留目录但让 Git 忽略它）\n\n你想怎么处理？\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"minimax-m2.5:free","usage":{"input":6098,"output":320,"cacheRead":11827,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18245,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775458852859,"responseId":"06228d256ed8905ee3d3653bc7b4108d"}}
