{"type":"message","id":"961b8509","parentId":"6a4fda4c","timestamp":"2026-04-06T07:06:08.696Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_fegtuugib2vd_1","toolName":"process","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"ts\":1775088136689,\"jobId\":\"1c3a7bd5-d835-41d8-a14a-d2970f13d503\",\"action\":\"finished\",\"status\":\"error\",\"error\":\"Channel is required when multiple channels are configured: feishu, openclaw-weixin Set delivery.channel explicitly or use a main session with a previous channel.\",\"summary\":\"自动备份已于 2026-04-02 00:00 执行。\\n\\n**结果：**\\n- ✅ Git 提交成功：`86fa05b`，51 个文件变更\\n- ❌ Git Push 失败：`Host key verification failed`\\n\\n**原因：** 远程仓库（GitHub/GitLab）主机密钥验证失败。\\n\\n**排查方向：**\\n1. 检查 `~/.ssh/known_hosts` 是否包含目标服务器密钥\\n2. 确认 SSH 私钥权限：`chmod 600 ~/.ssh/id_rsa`\\n3. 检查 git remote URL 是否正确：`git remote -v`\\n\\n需要我帮你排查 SSH 连接问题吗？\",\"deliveryStatus\":\"unknown\",\"sessionId\":\"24d28726-f208-4b3d-9999-ced1e8487d0b\",\"sessionKey\":\"agent:main:cron:1c3a7bd5-d835-41d8-a14a-d2970f13d503:run:24d28726-f208-4b3d-9999-ced1e8487d0b\",\"runAtMs\":1775088000003,\"durationMs\":136679,\"nextRunAtMs\":1775174400000,\"model\":\"MiniMax-M2.7\",\"provider\":\"minimax\",\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":1661,\"output_tokens\":251,\"total_tokens\":13422}}\n{\"ts\":1775174482169,\"jobId\":\"1c3a7bd5-d835-41d8-a14a-d2970f13d503\",\"action\":\"finished\",\"status\":\"error\",\"error\":\"Channel is required when multiple channels are configured: feishu, openclaw-weixin Set delivery.channel explicitly or use a main session with a previous channel.\",\"summary\":\"The cron job encountered a security policy block. Here's the summary:\\n\\n**Backup Execution Blocked**  \\nThe automated git backup command was denied due to security restrictions. The current policy requires explicit approval for commands matching this pattern.\\n\\n**Recommended Solutions**  \\n1. **Modify Security Policy**  \\n   - Change `security=allowlist` to `security=full` in tools.exec  \\n   - Add this command to the allowlist:  \\n     `cd ~/.openclaw && git add -A && git commit -m \\\"auto backup $(date +\\\\%Y-\\\\%m-\\\\%d)\\\" && git push && echo \\\"备份完成\\\"`\\n\\n2. **Enable UI Approvals**  \\n   - Use the OpenClaw Web UI or terminal approval interface to authorize this command\\n\\n3. **Alternative Approach**  \\n   - Create a scheduled task via `openclaw cron add` with explicit allowlist permissions\\n\\n**Next Steps**  \\nWould you like me to:  \\n1. Suggest specific policy changes?  \\n2. Help configure UI approvals?  \\n3. Propose a safer alternative backup method?\",\"deliveryStatus\":\"unknown\",\"sessionId\":\"00f4500d-fca8-4ab8-8b4d-2c6a0d23e158\",\"sessionKey\":\"agent:main:cron:1c3a7bd5-d835-41d8-a14a-d2970f13d503:run:00f4500d-fca8-4ab8-8b4d-2c6a0d23e158\",\"runAtMs\":1775174400003,\"durationMs\":82153,\"nextRunAtMs\":1775260800000,\"model\":\"openrouter/free\",\"provider\":\"openrouter\",\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":24845,\"output_tokens\":1166,\"total_tokens\":12116}}\n{\"ts\":1775260953677,\"jobId\":\"1c3a7bd5-d835-41d8-a14a-d2970f13d503\",\"action\":\"finished\",\"status\":\"error\",\"error\":\"Channel is required when multiple channels are configured: feishu, openclaw-weixin Set delivery.channel explicitly or use a main session with a previous channel.\",\"summary\":\"Git commit succeeded. The commit includes 3 files with the backup. The push failed due to SSH host key verification. Let me try to fix this:\",\"deliveryStatus\":\"unknown\",\"sessionId\":\"916f4205-e8d9-43d8-adf9-63770e960668\",\"sessionKey\":\"agent:main:cron:1c3a7bd5-d835-41d8-a14a-d2970f13d503:run:916f4205-e8d9-43d8-adf9-63770e960668\",\"runAtMs\":1775260800004,\"durationMs\":153656,\"nextRunAtMs\":1775347200000,\"model\":\"openrouter/free\",\"provider\":\"openrouter\",\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":139381,\"output_tokens\":1973,\"total_tokens\":16103}}\n{\"ts\":1775347301313,\"jobId\":\"1c3a7bd5-d835-41d8-a14a-d2970f13d503\",\"action\":\"finished\",\"status\":\"error\",\"error\":\"Channel is required when multiple channels are configured: feishu, openclaw-weixin Set delivery.channel explicitly or use a main session with a previous channel.\",\"summary\":\"The daily backup cron job failed due to a git submodule configuration issue. Here's the breakdown:\\n\\n1. **Submodule Problem**: The `workspace-wxlee/` directory isn't tracked by git, and there's no `.gitmodules` file to manage submodules\\n2. **Deleted Files**: Many session files were deleted but not committed, causing conflicts\\n3. **Permissions**: The cron job lacks write permissions for the workspace-wxlee/ directory\\n\\n**Solution Steps**:\\n1. Initialize submodules: `git submodule init`\\n2. Update submodules: `git submodule update`\\n3. Add changes: `git add -A`\\n4. Commit: `git commit -m \\\"auto backup $(date +\\\\%Y-\\\\%m-\\\\%d)\\\"`\\n5. Push: `git push`\\n\\n**Recommendation**: Add these steps to your cron job script, and ensure the cron user has write permissions to the workspace directory.\",\"deliveryStatus\":\"unknown\",\"sessionId\":\"f307ee1d-d849-4165-9a91-6559ef5af4c3\",\"sessionKey\":\"agent:main:cron:1c3a7bd5-d835-41d8-a14a-d2970f13d503:run:f307ee1d-d849-4165-9a91-6559ef5af4c3\",\"runAtMs\":1775347200003,\"durationMs\":101294,\"nextRunAtMs\":1775433600000,\"model\":\"openrouter/free\",\"provider\":\"openrouter\",\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":47166,\"output_tokens\":2307,\"total_tokens\":15188}}\n{\"ts\":1775433703028,\"jobId\":\"1c3a7bd5-d835-41d8-a14a-d2970f13d503\",\"action\":\"finished\",\"status\":\"ok\",\"delivered\":false,\"deliveryStatus\":\"not-delivered\",\"sessionId\":\"d071bf75-899e-41a9-b0bd-3898140e1a2f\",\"sessionKey\":\"agent:main:cron:1c3a7bd5-d835-41d8-a14a-d2970f13d503:run:d071bf75-899e-41a9-b0bd-3898140e1a2f\",\"runAtMs\":1775433600002,\"durationMs\":103008,\"nextRunAtMs\":1775520000000,\"model\":\"openrouter/free\",\"provider\":\"openrouter\",\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":23869,\"output_tokens\":9368,\"total_tokens\":11584}}\n\nProcess exited with code 0."}],"details":{"status":"completed","sessionId":"tidy-basil","exitCode":0,"aggregated":"{\"ts\":1775088136689,\"jobId\":\"1c3a7bd5-d835-41d8-a14a-d2970f13d503\",\"action\":\"finished\",\"status\":\"error\",\"error\":\"Channel is required when multiple channels are configured: feishu, openclaw-weixin Set delivery.channel explicitly or use a main session with a previous channel.\",\"summary\":\"自动备份已于 2026-04-02 00:00 执行。\\n\\n**结果：**\\n- ✅ Git 提交成功：`86fa05b`，51 个文件变更\\n- ❌ Git Push 失败：`Host key verification failed`\\n\\n**原因：** 远程仓库（GitHub/GitLab）主机密钥验证失败。\\n\\n**排查方向：**\\n1. 检查 `~/.ssh/known_hosts` 是否包含目标服务器密钥\\n2. 确认 SSH 私钥权限：`chmod 600 ~/.ssh/id_rsa`\\n3. 检查 git remote URL 是否正确：`git remote -v`\\n\\n需要我帮你排查 SSH 连接问题吗？\",\"deliveryStatus\":\"unknown\",\"sessionId\":\"24d28726-f208-4b3d-9999-ced1e8487d0b\",\"sessionKey\":\"agent:main:cron:1c3a7bd5-d835-41d8-a14a-d2970f13d503:run:24d28726-f208-4b3d-9999-ced1e8487d0b\",\"runAtMs\":1775088000003,\"durationMs\":136679,\"nextRunAtMs\":1775174400000,\"model\":\"MiniMax-M2.7\",\"provider\":\"minimax\",\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":1661,\"output_tokens\":251,\"total_tokens\":13422}}\n{\"ts\":1775174482169,\"jobId\":\"1c3a7bd5-d835-41d8-a14a-d2970f13d503\",\"action\":\"finished\",\"status\":\"error\",\"error\":\"Channel is required when multiple channels are configured: feishu, openclaw-weixin Set delivery.channel explicitly or use a main session with a previous channel.\",\"summary\":\"The cron job encountered a security policy block. Here's the summary:\\n\\n**Backup Execution Blocked**  \\nThe automated git backup command was denied due to security restrictions. The current policy requires explicit approval for commands matching this pattern.\\n\\n**Recommended Solutions**  \\n1. **Modify Security Policy**  \\n   - Change `security=allowlist` to `security=full` in tools.exec  \\n   - Add this command to the allowlist:  \\n     `cd ~/.openclaw && git add -A && git commit -m \\\"auto backup $(date +\\\\%Y-\\\\%m