 or use a main session with a previous channel.\",\"summary\":\"The daily backup cron job failed due to a git submodule configuration issue. Here's the breakdown:\\n\\n1. **Submodule Problem**: The `workspace-wxlee/` directory isn't tracked by git, and there's no `.gitmodules` file to manage submodules\\n2. **Deleted Files**: Many session files were deleted but not committed, causing conflicts\\n3. **Permissions**: The cron job lacks write permissions for the workspace-wxlee/ directory\\n\\n**Solution Steps**:\\n1. Initialize submodules: `git submodule init`\\n2. Update submodules: `git submodule update`\\n3. Add changes: `git add -A`\\n4. Commit: `git commit -m \\\"auto backup $(date +\\\\%Y-\\\\%m-\\\\%d)\\\"`\\n5. Push: `git push`\\n\\n**Recommendation**: Add these steps to your cron job script, and ensure the cron user has write permissions to the workspace directory.\",\"deliveryStatus\":\"unknown\",\"sessionId\":\"f307ee1d-d849-4165-9a91-6559ef5af4c3\",\"sessionKey\":\"agent:main:cron:1c3a7bd5-d835-41d8-a14a-d2970f13d503:run:f307ee1d-d849-4165-9a91-6559ef5af4c3\",\"runAtMs\":1775347200003,\"durationMs\":101294,\"nextRunAtMs\":1775433600000,\"model\":\"openrouter/free\",\"provider\":\"openrouter\",\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":47166,\"output_tokens\":2307,\"total_tokens\":15188}}\n{\"ts\":1775433703028,\"jobId\":\"1c3a7bd5-d835-41d8-a14a-d2970f13d503\",\"action\":\"finished\",\"status\":\"ok\",\"delivered\":false,\"deliveryStatus\":\"not-delivered\",\"sessionId\":\"d071bf75-899e-41a9-b0bd-3898140e1a2f\",\"sessionKey\":\"agent:main:cron:1c3a7bd5-d835-41d8-a14a-d2970f13d503:run:d071bf75-899e-41a9-b0bd-3898140e1a2f\",\"runAtMs\":1775433600002,\"durationMs\":103008,\"nextRunAtMs\":1775520000000,\"model\":\"openrouter/free\",\"provider\":\"openrouter\",\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":23869,\"output_tokens\":9368,\"total_tokens\":11584}}\n","name":"sleep 15"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775459168692}}
