{"type":"message","id":"0ebb4e32","parentId":"efe28028","timestamp":"2026-04-06T12:39:05.736Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking \"如何通过auth添加微信账户\" which means \"How to add a WeChat account through auth\". They're asking about the authentication system for adding a WeChat account.\n\nI see there's an `openclaw-weixin` directory in the OpenClaw config, which suggests there's already some WeChat integration set up. Let me check the accounts.json and the accounts directory to understand the current WeChat configuration.\n\nI should also look at the OpenClaw documentation to see how to add WeChat accounts through the auth system.","thinkingSignature":"0a0cb6e1b684ed6a92f5543627ee5658bae2e58e4ad5354f0b89d167a2685e82"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_7q0k9ddp0n8v_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file":"/home/node/.openclaw/openclaw-weixin/accounts.json"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_7q0k9ddp0n8v_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la ~/.openclaw/openclaw-weixin/accounts/"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_7q0k9ddp0n8v_3","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw auth --help 2>&1 || openclaw help auth 2>&1"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":39,"output":213,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":26807,"totalTokens":27059,"cost":{"input":0.0000117,"output":0.0002556,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.010052625,"total":0.010319925}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775479138669,"responseId":"0622dc63ba1706f43dc8fcac7fb0aba0"}}
