{"type":"message","id":"59817e66","parentId":"85fae335","timestamp":"2026-04-06T12:40:31.791Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see OpenClaw has an `openclaw-weixin` plugin installed. This is a WeChat plugin. Now I need to understand how to add a WeChat account. Let me check the plugin documentation or look at how the existing WeChat account is configured.","thinkingSignature":"10ef74dafe41019d2d2eb70e1ee8ddbe78a8a26e10c1f11d5eb591070309bde2"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_n6m07ws0squ5_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls /home/node/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-weixin/ 2>/dev/null | head -20"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_n6m07ws0squ5_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat /home/node/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-weixin/README.md 2>/dev/null | head -100 || cat /home/node/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-weixin/*.md 2>/dev/null | head -100"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":17595,"output":169,"cacheRead":11768,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":29532,"cost":{"input":0.005278499999999999,"output":0.0002028,"cacheRead":0.00070608,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.006187379999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775479227238,"responseId":"0622dcbb15c464cab9555cfd619d4a28"}}
{"type":"message","id":"538bdbde","parentId":"59817e66","timestamp":"2026-04-06T12:40:31.825Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_n6m07ws0squ5_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"CHANGELOG.md\nCHANGELOG.zh_CN.md\nLICENSE\nREADME.md\nREADME.zh_CN.md\nindex.ts\nnode_modules\nopenclaw.plugin.json\npackage-lock.json\npackage.json\nsrc"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":27,"aggregated":"CHANGELOG.md\nCHANGELOG.zh_CN.md\nLICENSE\nREADME.md\nREADME.zh_CN.md\nindex.ts\nnode_modules\nopenclaw.plugin.json\npackage-lock.json\npackage.json\nsrc","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775479231823}}
{"type":"message","id":"ae4e9a2c","parentId":"538bdbde","timestamp":"2026-04-06T12:40:31.828Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_n6m07ws0squ5_2","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# WeChat\n\n[简体中文](./README.zh_CN.md)\n\nOpenClaw's WeChat channel plugin, supporting login authorization via QR code scanning.\n\n## Compatibility\n\n| Plugin Version | OpenClaw Version       | npm dist-tag | Status      |\n|---------------|------------------------|--------------|-------------|\n| 2.0.x         | >=2026.3.22            | `latest`     | Active      |\n| 1.0.x         | >=2026.1.0 <2026.3.22  | `legacy`     | Maintenance |\n\n> The plugin checks the host version at startup and will refuse to load if the\n> running OpenClaw version is outside the supported range.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n[OpenClaw](https://docs.openclaw.ai/install) must be installed (the `openclaw` CLI needs to be available).\n\nCheck your version: `openclaw --version`\n\n## Quick Install\n\n```bash\nnpx -y @tencent-weixin/openclaw-weixin-cli install\n```\n\n## Manual Installation\n\nIf the quick install doesn't work, follow these steps manually:\n\n### 1. Install the plugin\n\n```bash\nopenclaw plugins install \"@tencent-weixin/openclaw-weixin\"\n```\n\n### 2. Enable the plugin\n\n```bash\nopenclaw config set plugins.entries.openclaw-weixin.enabled true\n```\n\n### 3. QR code login\n\n```bash\nopenclaw channels login --channel openclaw-weixin\n```\n\nA QR code will appear in the terminal. Scan it with your phone and confirm the authorization. Once confirmed, the login credentials will be saved locally automatically — no further action is needed.\n\n### 4. Restart the gateway\n\n```bash\nopenclaw gateway restart\n```\n\n## Adding More WeChat Accounts\n\n```bash\nopenclaw channels login --channel openclaw-weixin\n```\n\nEach QR code login creates a new account entry, supporting multiple WeChat accounts online simultaneously.\n\n## Multi-Account Context Isolation\n\nBy default, all channels share the same AI conversation context. To isolate conversation context for each WeChat account:\n\n```bash\nopenclaw config set agents.mode per-channel-per-peer\n```\n\nThis gives each \"WeChat account + message sender\" combination its own independent AI memory, preventing context cross-talk between accounts.\n\n## Backend API Protocol\n\nThis plugin communicates with the backend gateway via HTTP JSON API. Developers integrating with their own backend need to implement the following interfaces.\n\nAll endpoints use `POST` with JSON request and response bodies. Common request headers:\n\n| Header | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `Content-Type` | `application/json` |\n| `AuthorizationType` | Fixed value `ilink_bot_token` |\n| `Authorization` | `Bearer <token>` (obtained after login) |\n| `X-WECHAT-UIN` | Base64-encoded random uint32 |\n\n### Endpoint List\n\n| Endpoint | Path | Description |\n|----------|------|-------------|\n| getUpdates | `getupdates` | Long-poll for new messages |\n| sendMessage | `sendmessage` | Send a message (text/image/video/file) |\n| getUploadUrl | `getuploadurl` | Get CDN upload pre-signed URL |\n| getConfig | `getconfig` | Get account config (typing ticket, etc.) |\n| sendTyping | `sendtyping` | Send/cancel typing status indicator |\n\n### getUpdates"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":29,"aggregated":"# WeChat\n\n[简体中文](./README.zh_CN.md)\n\nOpenClaw's WeChat channel plugin, supporting login authorization via QR code scanning.\n\n## Compatibility\n\n| Plugin Version | OpenClaw Version       | npm dist-tag | Status      |\n|---------------|------------------------|--------------|-------------|\n| 2.0.x         | >=2026.3.22            | `latest`     | Active      |\n| 1.0.x         | >=2026.1.0 <2026.3.22  | `legacy`     | Maintenance |\n\n> The plugin checks the host version at startup and will refuse to load if the\n> running OpenClaw version is outside the supported range.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n[OpenClaw](https://docs.openclaw.ai/install) must be installed (the `openclaw` CLI needs to be available).\n\nCheck your version: `openclaw --version`\n\n## Quick Install\n\n```bash\nnpx -y @tencent-weixin/openclaw-weixin-cli install\n```\n\n## Manual Installation\n\nIf the quick install doesn't work, follow these steps manually:\n\n### 1. Install the plugin\n\n```bash\nopenclaw plugins install \"@tencent-weixin/openclaw-weixin\"\n```\n\n### 2. Enable the plugin\n\n```bash\nopenclaw config set plugins.entries.openclaw-weixin.enabled true\n```\n\n### 3. QR code login\n\n```bash\nopenclaw channels login --channel openclaw-weixin\n```\n\nA QR code will appear in the terminal. Scan it with your phone and confirm the authorization. Once confirmed, the login credentials will be saved locally automatically — no further action is needed.\n\n### 4. Restart the gateway\n\n```bash\nopenclaw gateway restart\n```\n\n## Adding More WeChat Accounts\n\n```bash\nopenclaw channels login --channel openclaw-weixin\n```\n\nEach QR code login creates a new account entry, supporting multiple WeChat accounts online simultaneously.\n\n## Multi-Account Context Isolation\n\nBy default, all channels share the same AI conversation context. To isolate conversation context for each WeChat account:\n\n```bash\nopenclaw config set agents.mode per-channel-per-peer\n```\n\nThis gives each \"WeChat account + message sender\" combination its own independent AI memory, preventing context cross-talk between accounts.\n\n## Backend API Protocol\n\nThis plugin communicates with the backend gateway via HTTP JSON API. Developers integrating with their own backend need to implement the following interfaces.\n\nAll endpoints use `POST` with JSON request and response bodies. Common request headers:\n\n| Header | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `Content-Type` | `application/json` |\n| `AuthorizationType` | Fixed value `ilink_bot_token` |\n| `Authorization` | `Bearer <token>` (obtained after login) |\n| `X-WECHAT-UIN` | Base64-encoded random uint32 |\n\n### Endpoint List\n\n| Endpoint | Path | Description |\n|----------|------|-------------|\n| getUpdates | `getupdates` | Long-poll for new messages |\n| sendMessage | `sendmessage` | Send a message (text/image/video/file) |\n| getUploadUrl | `getuploadurl` | Get CDN upload pre-signed URL |\n| getConfig | `getconfig` | Get account config (typing ticket, etc.) |\n| sendTyping | `sendtyping` | Send/cancel typing status indicator |\n\n### getUpdates","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775479231826}}
{"type":"message","id":"caadcd22","parentId":"ae4e9a2c","timestamp":"2026-04-06T12:40:41.311Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I found the documentation. The user wants to know how to add a WeChat account via auth. According to the README:\n\n1. Install the plugin (it's already installed)\n2. Enable the plugin (it's already enabled)\n3. QR code login: `openclaw channels login --channel openclaw-weixin`\n\nThe user is asking specifically about how to add via \"auth\". Let me provide them with the instructions based on the documentation.\n\nThe key command is:\n```bash\nopenclaw channels login --channel openclaw-weixin\n```\n\nThis will show a QR code for scanning with WeChat. Each QR code login creates a new account entry, supporting multiple WeChat accounts online simultaneously.","thinkingSignature":"4122b37f235a05fd1349906fc87a6ac00c804eed0456dccb5d2f3275d34e0ca7"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n通过 `openclaw channels login` 添加微信账户：\n\n**步骤：**\n\n1. **扫码登录**\n   ```bash\n   openclaw channels login --channel openclaw-weixin\n   ```\n   终端会显示二维码，用微信扫码确认授权即可\n\n2. **多账户支持**\n   每次扫码登录会创建一个新账户，无需额外配置\n\n3. **重启网关**\n   ```bash\n   openclaw gateway restart\n   ```\n\n---\n\n**注意事项：**\n- 当前已有一个微信机器人：`ff482f9682b2-im-bot`（保存在 `openclaw-weixin/accounts/`）\n- 每个微信账户登录后会生成独立的 credentials 文件\n- 如需隔离不同账户的对话上下文：\n  ```bash\n  openclaw config set agents.mode per-channel-per-peer\n  ```\n\n需要我帮你执行扫码登录吗？\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":18515,"output":318,"cacheRead":11768,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":30601,"cost":{"input":0.0055544999999999995,"output":0.0003816,"cacheRead":0.00070608,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.006642179999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775479231830,"responseId":"0622dcc056a0cf5eb29ce79a49c6ee94"}}
