{"type":"message","id":"bcb6d66a","parentId":"2ed73612","timestamp":"2026-04-06T13:01:39.879Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking for the complete command to add a WeChat account using `openclaw channels login`. They want the full command, likely because the previous response wasn't clear or they want to run it directly.\n\nLet me provide the complete command and any necessary context.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**完整命令：**\n\n```bash\nopenclaw channels login --channel openclaw-weixin\n```\n\n**执行后会显示二维码终端界面：**\n\n```\n[openclaw-weixin] 请使用微信扫描二维码登录\n█████████████████████████████████\n█████████████████████████████████\n... (二维码图案) ...\n█████████████████████████████████\nWaiting for scan...\n```\n\n**操作流程：**\n1. 运行上述命令\n2. 终端显示二维码\n3. 打开微信 → 扫一扫 → 扫描终端二维码\n4. 手机上点击\"确认登录\"\n5. 登录成功，账户信息自动保存到 `~/.openclaw/openclaw-weixin/accounts/`\n\n**查看已添加的账户：**\n```bash\nls ~/.openclaw/openclaw-weixin/accounts/\n```\n\n需要我现在执行这个命令吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775480484632,"responseId":"021775480485159862b320fedb5acedb2c0c7ad2efa244a2a98ca"}}
